   "text": "Device page: OS RF-Power-Monitor\nmains power, mains lost over 60 s,\nmains changes, CPU and ambient\ntemperature, firmware state and\nlast update, update-site check-in,\nminutes since check-in (warn > 60);\nCPU, RAM, LittleFS, eth0, IPv4/IPv6,\nLLDP neighbour, inventory",
   "originalText": "Device page: OS RF-Power-Monitor\nmains power, mains lost over 60 s,\nmains changes, CPU and ambient\ntemperature, firmware state and\nlast update, update-site check-in,\nminutes since check-in (warn > 60);\nCPU, RAM, LittleFS, eth0, IPv4/IPv6,\nLLDP neighbour, inventory",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
