   "seed": 1253391529,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 20037774,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Definitions: librenms/os_detection and os_discovery (rfpowermonitor.yaml) and the MIB, see docs/LIBRENMS.md. A fresh LibreNMS has no alert rules:\nadd \"State Sensor Critical\" from the rule collection. Short outages only show as a warning and a step in \"Mains power changes\".\nDocker Desktop hides the sender's address: the trap handler uses the address in the trap, syslog-ng keeps the hostname.",
   "originalText": "Definitions: librenms/os_detection and os_discovery (rfpowermonitor.yaml) and the MIB, see docs/LIBRENMS.md. A fresh LibreNMS has no alert rules:\nadd \"State Sensor Critical\" from the rule collection. Short outages only show as a warning and a step in \"Mains power changes\".\nDocker Desktop hides the sender's address: the trap handler uses the address in the trap, syslog-ng keeps the hostname.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
